LZMA SDK 26.06 (Igor Pavlov), public domain.
Vendored from the official 7-Zip 26.06 SDK (https://www.7-zip.org/sdk.html),
file lzma2606.7z SHA-256 1d9da340870b12712e9068be178a4436fbad785486b62aed6e2aa88ea1e3bb65
(https://github.com/ip7z/7zip/releases/download/26.06/lzma2606.7z).

Only the ANSI-C LZMA encoder/decoder used by qze is copied here (single-thread,
compiled with -DZ7_ST). See lzma-sdk.txt for the license (public domain).

Do not compile LzFindMt/Threads; qze already parallelizes at block level.
